/*
 * product-sheets.js -- SHARED, framework-agnostic sheet renders.
 *
 *   renderSpecSheet(canonical)  -> HTML string (spec / ficha tecnica)
 *   renderSalesSheet(canonical) -> HTML string (one-page / sales sheet)
 *   injectSheetStyles(doc?)     -> idempotently inject the sheet CSS + fonts
 *   hydrateBarcodes(rootEl, JsBarcode?) -> fill <svg> barcode placeholders after mount
 *
 * Consumes the canonical object from productToSheetData() (shared-sheets/adapter.js).
 * PURE markup -- no export logic baked in (CLAUDE.md invariant 13). The host mounts the
 * string, calls injectSheetStyles() once, then hydrateBarcodes() after the node is live.
 *
 * Render bodies + CSS + base64 brand logos + BRAND_DEFAULTS + barcode options are PORTED
 * VERBATIM from the two standalone generators (lt_spec_sheet_gen, lt_1_page-generator).
 * Only host-coupling was removed: the DOM writes (#pageWrap / metaTitle / overflow /
 * scaleToFit) became `return <string>`, and the generators' `state` is built from the
 * canonical object by the two mappers below. The two BRAND_DEFAULTS are kept separate
 * (spec uses bare 'hotline'; sales uses 'hotline-blanca/-tv/-audio/-cuidado') --
 * reconciliation is pending per CLAUDE.md invariant 7.
 *
 * GENERATED once by /tmp/assemble_sheets.py from the generators; safe to hand-edit after.
 */

